                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "Can the common fixes and infrastructure be in a commit or two before? \nIt just makes git history, etc better. Easier code to maintain."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jason Westover",
                        "email": "jwestover@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "j-westover"
                    },
                    "message": "Do you mean let's get the Vite stuff in first?\nI would have to rebase either way (and port the vue.config stuff here if it follows vite), so I'm open to this going now or later."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "1) Yes, let's get the vite stuff first in. \n\n2) But ideally 1 commit for the language stuff:\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/webui-vue/+/86590/2/src/locales/ru-RU.json\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/webui-vue/+/86590/2/src/locales/en-US.json\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/webui-vue/+/86590/2/src/locales/ka-GE.json\nare 1 commit\n\n3) Things like SCSS Infrastructure:\n- Add !default flags to _colors.scss for theme overrideability\n- Explode SCSS imports in vue.config.js for proper import ordering\n- Add Bootstrap helpers and utilities/api imports\n- Add .visually-hidden backfill for accessibility\n- Remove redundant Bootstrap CSS import from _buttons.scss\n- Fix color() function usage in _pagination.scss\n\nComponent Fixes:\n- AppHeader: Add CSS for navbar flex layout fixes\n- AppNavigation: Use :deep() to pierce b-collapse boundary\n- InputPasswordToggle: Full-width container for proper layout\n- FormFile: Improve file name display with word-break\nare 1 or more commits (a few is probably best) \n\n4) And then 1 commit for Nvidia theming \n- Add NVIDIA theme with design tokens and button styling\n- _nvidia.scss: NVIDIA theme with brand colors\n\n5) And then even fixing the existing theming is another \n- Add theme-colors map to IBM, Intel, and NVIDIA themes\n- Ensures theme-color() function uses vendor colors"
                },
